title: the Banners Membership Dwindles
subtitle: Our unpopularity has impaired the the Banners's recruitment ability.
view-if: rb_militancy >= 0.1 and commons_marcher_normalized + disfavored_marcher_normalized < (commons_collectivist_normalized + commons_royalist_normalized + commons_traditionalist_normalized + (rb_militancy*100)) and time >= banner_unpopularity_time
new-page: true
tags: event
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/tnoreference.png";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}
on-arrival: banner_unpopularity_time = time + 6

= the Banners Membership Dwindles

Unfortunately, the the Banners's effectiveness is dragged down by the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>'s unpopularity, as the workers aren't particularly enthusiastic about joining. [? if left_strength >= 40: However, more militant members from our left wing have largely remained. ?] [? if marcher_votes >= 29: Furthermore, we are unable to recruit significant amount of supporters from non-worker demographics. ?]

- @reichsbanner_joever: Unfortunate.

@reichsbanner_joever
on-arrival: rb_strength *= 0.9; rb_militancy *= 0.8 if left_strength < 40; rb_militancy *= 0.9 if left_strength >= 40

This will continue to be a problem if our popularity continues to flag.
